    narr:generatedFrom "4160d74da2932b700882cc171f7f4dff81b6f392" ;
    narr:narration """On 2026-08-21 this hub records the establishment of a single binding control: a signed-release-manifest gate on Meridian deployments. [Quinton Fairweather announces the rule](narr:Expr_1ProtectedBaseProbe_1) as a new requirement — every Meridian deployment must carry a signed manifest before shipping. The gate is then [restated as a recorded decision item](narr:Expr_1ProtectedBaseProbe_3), with its [scope fixed to staging and production](narr:Expr_1ProtectedBaseProbe_4) and [ownership assigned to Fairweather himself](narr:Expr_1ProtectedBaseProbe_5). All four children share the same date, actor, and decision-conviction register — this is one gate being declared, not a debate. The [broader narrative frame](narr:Narrative_SignedReleaseManifestGating) names the origin: unsigned-artifact exposure converted into a standing, ownership-assigned signing gate. That broader child also carries a forward-looking frame — asking what incidents, environments, or exceptions would cause the requirement to be extended, tightened, waived, or reassigned — which points beyond the current establishment toward future modification of the same control.""" ;
    narr:covers <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1ProtectedBaseProbe_1> ;
    narr:covers <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1ProtectedBaseProbe_3> ;
    narr:covers <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1ProtectedBaseProbe_4> ;
    narr:covers <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1ProtectedBaseProbe_5> ;
    narr:covers <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Narrative_SignedReleaseManifestGating> ;
    narr:keyPhrase [ narr:text "Every Meridian deployment now requires a signed release\nmanifest before it ships." ; narr:phraseSource <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1ProtectedBaseProbe_1> ] ;
    narr:keyPhrase [ narr:text "**Gate**: signed release manifest required for Meridian deploys" ; narr:phraseSource <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1ProtectedBaseProbe_3> ] ;
    narr:keyPhrase [ narr:text "**Scope**: applies to staging and production" ; narr:phraseSource <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1ProtectedBaseProbe_4> ] ;
    narr:keyPhrase [ narr:text "**Owner**: Quinton Fairweather" ; narr:phraseSource <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1ProtectedBaseProbe_5> ] ;
    narr:variation [ narr:text "The broader narrative child frames forward — extensions, waivers, reassignment of the gate — while the four probe children only establish it as it stands today." ; narr:over <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Narrative_SignedReleaseManifestGating> ; narr:over <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1ProtectedBaseProbe_1> ] ;
    narr:writer "z-ai/glm-5.2" .
